                                                "sense_id": "b9833f35-f9d8-30aa-831e-eef29f0e9b25",
                                                "text": "Although these six classifications of the scope and responsibility and specific engineering expertise are interesting and useful, they come from within engineering itself and they don’t help us to disentangle STEM."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2c68442-ac02-4dc2-a418-29b2f9148b03",
                                                "sense_id": "b9833f35-f9d8-30aa-831e-eef29f0e9b25",
                                                "text": "Table 7 shows that in general, the STEM subjects share more phrases with each other, while the opposite is true for the humanities subjects."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d074c52-619e-4e3c-97b5-57828d26f612",
                                                "sense_id": "b9833f35-f9d8-30aa-831e-eef29f0e9b25",
                                                "text": "Despite wide efforts to encourage more girls and young women to pursue careers in STEM, a new survey from Gallup and the Walton Family Foundation found Gen Z girls significantly lag behind boys in the level of interest expressed in STEM subjects, suggesting more must be done to close the gender gap."
                                            }
